voices.description:
Pick a voice from the list or type its name. Empty = engine default.

Extra options are passed to the engine as they are, as a YAML mapping (for example `rate: "+10%"`). The voice field wins over a `voice` key.

Primary engine accepts: {primary_options_supported}
